      "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udfe1 Changes recommended\n\nEmpty required attached values can be accepted but serialized as bare options with different Git semantics.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>1 open finding</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Reject empty values for required attached options](https://github.com/ash-r1/type-git/pull/135#discussion_r4254948595) \u00b7 New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nAdds typed validation for reflog operations and delegated `stash show` parsing.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Models reflog defaults, operand arity, and stash-attached short values.\n- Adds object-filter and dirstat constraints.\n- Expands runtime, type, integration, and generated coverage.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `.changeset/\u200breflog-stash-command-scopes.md` | Records the minor API expansion. |\r\n| `docs/\u200bdesign/\u200bcommand-coverage.md` | Lists new reviewed scopes. |\r\n| `docs/\u200bdesign/\u200bcommand-exploration.json` | Updates generated constraint exploration. |\r\n| `docs/\u200bdesign/\u200btyped-command-api.md` | Documents parser behavior and limitations. |\r\n| `scripts/\u200bcommand-domains.mjs` | Includes initial state in domains. |\r\n| `scripts/\u200bcommands.mjs` | Validates initial-state keys. |\r\n| `scripts/\u200bgit-options.mjs` | Emits command initial state. |\r\n| `scripts/\u200bimport-revision-options.py` | Recognizes parenthesized literals. |\r\n| `spec/\u200bcommand-audit.json` | Audits new command scopes. |\r\n| `spec/\u200bgit-command-rules.json` | Defines reflog and stash arity rules. |\r\n| `spec/\u200bgit-command-scopes.json` | Adds reflog and stash specifications. |\r\n| `spec/\u200bgit-option-groups.json` | Adds filter and dirstat behavior. |\r\n| `spec/\u200bupstream/\u200bgit-revision-options.json` | Records filter spellings. |\r\n| `src/\u200bcommands/\u200bbuild.ts` | Applies defaults and attached values. |\r\n| `src/\u200bcommands/\u200breflog-stash.test.ts` | Tests new command behavior. |\r\n| `src/\u200bcommands/\u200brevision-diff.test.ts` | Tests filter and dirstat constraints. |\r\n| `src/\u200bcommands/\u200bspec.ts` | Extends option and command schemas. |\r\n| `src/\u200bcommands/\u200btypes.ts` | Initializes literal-validation state. |\r\n| `test/\u200bnpm-integration/\u200btypescript/\u200btest.ts` | Validates published declarations. |\r\n| `test/\u200btypes/\u200bcommand-api.ts` | Adds compile-time command fixtures. |\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced\n\n---\n\n\ud83d\udca1 <a href=\"/ash-r1/type-git/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>",
